{
  "uid": "ci-investigation",
  "title": "CI Investigation",
  "timezone": "utc",
  "refresh": "",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-7d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "job_type",
        "label": "Job Type",
        "type": "query",
        "query": "label_values(ci_test_platform_insights_additional_context_duration_seconds{name=\"execution_completed\"}, job_name)",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": { "selected": true, "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "pr_number",
        "label": "PR",
        "type": "query",
        "query": "label_values(ci_test_platform_insights_additional_context_duration_seconds{name=\"execution_completed\",job_name=~\"$job_type\"}, pr_number)",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": { "selected": true, "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 3
      },
      {
        "name": "build_id",
        "label": "Build",
        "type": "query",
        "query": "label_values(ci_test_platform_insights_additional_context_duration_seconds{name=\"execution_completed\",pr_number=~\"$pr_number\",job_name=~\"$job_type\"}, build_id)",
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": { "selected": true, "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 3
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 50,
      "title": "Dashboard Guide",
      "type": "row",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 51,
      "title": "",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
          "options": {
            "mode": "markdown",
            "content": "### How to use this dashboard\n\nThis dashboard helps investigate CI failures at two levels:\n\n**General investigation** (all filters set to \"All\"):\n1. Check summary stats for overall CI health.\n2. Look at **Top Failing PRs** to find which PRs have the most failures. Select a PR from the **PR** dropdown to drill down.\n3. Compare **PR Success Rate vs Global** to see if failures are systemic or isolated.\n4. Check **Step Failure Leaderboard** to see which ci-operator steps fail most.\n5. Look at **Longest/Shortest Runs** for outlier builds.\n\n**Specific PR investigation** (set the PR filter):\n1. All panels update to show only that PR's data.\n2. Compare your PR's success rate against the global baseline.\n3. See which steps are failing in your builds.\n4. Expand **Build Detail** for full build history and error logs.\n\n**Links:** Click PR numbers for GitHub PRs, commit SHAs for GitHub commits, and Build IDs for Prow job pages.\n\n**Filters:**\n- **Job Type** -- narrow to specific CI jobs.\n- **PR** -- leave as \"All\" for general investigation, or select specific PRs.\n- **Build** -- narrow to specific build IDs."
          }
    },
    {
      "id": 100,
      "title": "Context",
      "type": "row",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 7 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "title": "Total Builds",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(count_over_time((group by (build_id) (ci_test_platform_insights_additional_context_duration_seconds{name=\"execution_completed\",pr_number=~\"$pr_number\",build_id=~\"$build_id\",job_name=~\"$job_type\"}))[$__range:]))",
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue" }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "title": "Success Rate",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 8 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(count_over_time((group by (build_id) (ci_test_platform_insights_additional_context_duration_seconds{name=\"execution_completed\",success=\"true\",pr_number=~\"$pr_number\",build_id=~\"$build_id\",job_name=~\"$job_type\"}))[$__range:])) / count(count_over_time((group by (build_id) (ci_test_platform_insights_additional_context_duration_seconds{name=\"execution_completed\",pr_number=~\"$pr_number\",build_id=~\"$build_id\",job_name=~\"$job_type\"}))[$__range:])) * 100",
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 50 },
              { "color": "green", "value": 80 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "title": "Avg Retries / Commit",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 8 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "avg(sum by (pr_number, pr_sha) (count_over_time((group by (build_id, pr_number, pr_sha) (ci_test_platform_insights_additional_context_duration_seconds{name=\"execution_completed\",pr_number=~\"$pr_number\",build_id=~\"$build_id\",job_name=~\"$job_type\"}))[$__range:])))",
          "instant": false,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 3 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 5 }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 200,
      "title": "Identify Problems",
      "type": "row",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 12 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "title": "Top Failing PRs",
      "description": "PRs with the most failed builds. Click a bar to filter this dashboard to that PR.",
      "type": "bargauge",
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 13 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(20, count by (pr_number) (count_over_time((group by (build_id, pr_number) (ci_test_platform_insights_additional_context_duration_seconds{name=\"execution_completed\",success=\"false\",pr_number=~\"$pr_number\",job_name=~\"$job_type\"}))[$__range:])) and on() (count(count by (pr_number) (count_over_time((group by (build_id, pr_number) (ci_test_platform_insights_additional_context_duration_seconds{name=\"execution_completed\",success=\"false\",pr_number=~\"$pr_number\",job_name=~\"$job_type\"}))[$__range:]))) > 1))",
          "legendFormat": "PR {{pr_number}}",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "noValue": "Single PR selected",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "red"
          },
          "links": [
            {
              "title": "Investigate this PR",
              "url": "/d/ci-investigation/ci-investigation?var-pr_number=${__field.labels.pr_number}&var-job_type=${job_type}&var-build_id=All&from=${__from}&to=${__to}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "basic",
        "showUnfilled": true,
        "minVizWidth": 0,
        "minVizHeight": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "PR Success Rate vs Global",
      "description": "Compare a specific PR's success rate to the overall system. If both are low, it's systemic. If only yours is low, investigate your code.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 13 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(count_over_time((group by (build_id) (ci_test_platform_insights_additional_context_duration_seconds{name=\"execution_completed\",success=\"true\",job_name=~\"$job_type\"}))[$__interval:])) / count(count_over_time((group by (build_id) (ci_test_platform_insights_additional_context_duration_seconds{name=\"execution_completed\",job_name=~\"$job_type\"}))[$__interval:])) * 100",
          "legendFormat": "Global",
          "refId": "A",
          "interval": "3h"
        },
        {
          "expr": "count(count_over_time((group by (build_id) (ci_test_platform_insights_additional_context_duration_seconds{name=\"execution_completed\",success=\"true\",pr_number=~\"$pr_number\",job_name=~\"$job_type\"}))[$__interval:])) / count(count_over_time((group by (build_id) (ci_test_platform_insights_additional_context_duration_seconds{name=\"execution_completed\",pr_number=~\"$pr_number\",job_name=~\"$job_type\"}))[$__interval:])) * 100",
          "legendFormat": "Selected PRs",
          "refId": "B",
          "interval": "3h"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "pointSize": 5,
            "showPoints": "auto"
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Global" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "blue", "mode": "fixed" } }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byRegexp", "options": "Selected.*" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "yellow", "mode": "fixed" } },
              { "id": "custom.lineWidth", "value": 3 }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" },
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 300,
      "title": "Failure Analysis",
      "type": "row",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 23 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "title": "Step Failure Leaderboard",
      "description": "Which ci-operator steps fail most often within the selected scope.",
      "type": "bargauge",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 24 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(15, count by (source) (count_over_time((group by (build_id, source) (ci_step_duration_seconds{level=\"Error\",pr_number=~\"$pr_number\",build_id=~\"$build_id\",job_name=~\"$job_type\"}))[$__range:])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}}",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "red"
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "displayMode": "basic",
        "showUnfilled": true
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 350,
      "title": "Outliers",
      "type": "row",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 32 },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "title": "Longest Runs",
      "description": "Individual pipeline runs sorted by duration. Long runs may indicate stuck tests or infrastructure issues.",
      "type": "table",
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 33 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "topk(20, max_over_time(ci_test_platform_insights_additional_context_duration_seconds{name=\"execution_completed\",pr_number=~\"$pr_number\",build_id=~\"$build_id\",job_name=~\"$job_type\"}[$__range]))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": { "Time": true, "__name__": true, "name": true, "branch": true, "timestamp": true, "author": true },
            "renameByName": { "pr_number": "PR", "pr_sha": "Commit", "job_name": "Job", "build_id": "Build ID", "success": "Outcome", "Value": "Duration", "org": "org", "repo": "repo" },
            "indexByName": { "pr_number": 0, "pr_sha": 1, "job_name": 2, "success": 3, "Value": 4, "build_id": 5, "org": 6, "repo": 7 }
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Duration" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "unit", "value": "s" },
              { "id": "custom.width", "value": 80 }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "PR" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "custom.width", "value": 80 },
              { "id": "links", "value": [{ "title": "GitHub PR", "url": "https://github.com/${__data.fields.org}/${__data.fields.repo}/pull/${__value.raw}", "targetBlank": true }] }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Commit" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "custom.width", "value": 115 },
              { "id": "links", "value": [{ "title": "GitHub Commit", "url": "https://github.com/${__data.fields.org}/${__data.fields.repo}/commit/${__value.raw}", "targetBlank": true }] }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Outcome" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "custom.width", "value": 75 },
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  { "type": "value", "options": { "true": { "text": "Success", "color": "green" } } },
                  { "type": "value", "options": { "false": { "text": "Failure", "color": "red" } } }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Build ID" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "custom.width", "value": 175 },
              { "id": "links", "value": [{ "title": "Prow Job", "url": "https://prow.ci.openshift.org/view/gs/test-platform-results/pr-logs/pull/${__data.fields.org}_${__data.fields.repo}/${__data.fields.PR}/${__data.fields.Job}/${__value.raw}", "targetBlank": true }] }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "org" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "custom.hidden", "value": true }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "repo" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "custom.hidden", "value": true }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "sortBy": [{ "displayName": "Duration", "desc": true }]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "title": "Shortest Runs",
      "description": "Runs that completed unusually fast. Short failed runs often indicate infrastructure failures rather than test failures.",
      "type": "table",
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 33 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "bottomk(20, min_over_time(ci_test_platform_insights_additional_context_duration_seconds{name=\"execution_completed\",pr_number=~\"$pr_number\",build_id=~\"$build_id\",job_name=~\"$job_type\"}[$__range]))",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": { "Time": true, "__name__": true, "name": true, "branch": true, "timestamp": true, "author": true },
            "renameByName": { "pr_number": "PR", "pr_sha": "Commit", "job_name": "Job", "build_id": "Build ID", "success": "Outcome", "Value": "Duration", "org": "org", "repo": "repo" },
            "indexByName": { "pr_number": 0, "pr_sha": 1, "job_name": 2, "success": 3, "Value": 4, "build_id": 5, "org": 6, "repo": 7 }
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Duration" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "unit", "value": "s" },
              { "id": "custom.width", "value": 80 }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "PR" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "custom.width", "value": 80 },
              { "id": "links", "value": [{ "title": "GitHub PR", "url": "https://github.com/${__data.fields.org}/${__data.fields.repo}/pull/${__value.raw}", "targetBlank": true }] }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Commit" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "custom.width", "value": 115 },
              { "id": "links", "value": [{ "title": "GitHub Commit", "url": "https://github.com/${__data.fields.org}/${__data.fields.repo}/commit/${__value.raw}", "targetBlank": true }] }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Outcome" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "custom.width", "value": 75 },
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  { "type": "value", "options": { "true": { "text": "Success", "color": "green" } } },
                  { "type": "value", "options": { "false": { "text": "Failure", "color": "red" } } }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Build ID" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "custom.width", "value": 175 },
              { "id": "links", "value": [{ "title": "Prow Job", "url": "https://prow.ci.openshift.org/view/gs/test-platform-results/pr-logs/pull/${__data.fields.org}_${__data.fields.repo}/${__data.fields.PR}/${__data.fields.Job}/${__value.raw}", "targetBlank": true }] }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "org" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "custom.hidden", "value": true }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "repo" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "custom.hidden", "value": true }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "sortBy": [{ "displayName": "Duration", "desc": false }]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 400,
      "title": "Build Detail",
      "type": "row",
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 43 },
      "collapsed": true,
      "panels": [
        {
          "id": 40,
          "title": "Build History",
          "description": "All builds matching the current filters. Shows pass/fail pattern across commits.",
          "type": "table",
          "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 44 },
          "targets": [
            {
              "expr": "last_over_time(ci_test_platform_insights_additional_context_duration_seconds{name=\"execution_completed\",pr_number=~\"$pr_number\",build_id=~\"$build_id\",job_name=~\"$job_type\"}[$__range])",
              "format": "table",
              "instant": true,
              "refId": "A"
            }
          ],
          "transformations": [
            {
              "id": "organize",
              "options": {
                "excludeByName": { "Time": true, "__name__": true, "name": true, "branch": true, "timestamp": true, "author": true },
                "renameByName": { "pr_number": "PR", "pr_sha": "Commit", "job_name": "Job", "build_id": "Build ID", "success": "Outcome", "Value": "Duration", "org": "org", "repo": "repo" },
                "indexByName": { "pr_number": 0, "pr_sha": 1, "job_name": 2, "success": 3, "Value": 4, "build_id": 5, "org": 6, "repo": 7 }
              }
            }
          ],
          "fieldConfig": {
            "defaults": {
              "custom": { "filterable": false }
            },
            "overrides": [
              {
                "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Duration" },
                "properties": [
                  { "id": "unit", "value": "s" },
                  { "id": "custom.width", "value": 80 }
                ]
              },
              {
                "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "PR" },
                "properties": [
                  { "id": "custom.width", "value": 60 },
                  { "id": "links", "value": [{ "title": "GitHub PR", "url": "https://github.com/${__data.fields.org}/${__data.fields.repo}/pull/${__value.raw}", "targetBlank": true }] }
                ]
              },
              {
                "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Commit" },
                "properties": [
                  { "id": "custom.width", "value": 115 },
                  { "id": "links", "value": [{ "title": "GitHub Commit", "url": "https://github.com/${__data.fields.org}/${__data.fields.repo}/commit/${__value.raw}", "targetBlank": true }] }
                ]
              },
              {
                "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Outcome" },
                "properties": [
                  { "id": "custom.width", "value": 75 },
                  {
                    "id": "mappings",
                    "value": [
                      { "type": "value", "options": { "true": { "text": "Success", "color": "green" } } },
                      { "type": "value", "options": { "false": { "text": "Failure", "color": "red" } } }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Build ID" },
                "properties": [
                  { "id": "custom.width", "value": 175 },
                  { "id": "links", "value": [{ "title": "Prow Job", "url": "https://prow.ci.openshift.org/view/gs/test-platform-results/pr-logs/pull/${__data.fields.org}_${__data.fields.repo}/${__data.fields.PR}/${__data.fields.Job}/${__value.raw}", "targetBlank": true }] }
                ]
              },
              {
                "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "org" },
                "properties": [{ "id": "custom.hidden", "value": true }]
              },
              {
                "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "repo" },
                "properties": [{ "id": "custom.hidden", "value": true }]
              }
            ]
          },
          "options": {
            "sortBy": [{ "displayName": "Build ID", "desc": true }]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "title": "Errors & Warnings",
          "description": "Pipeline-level errors and warnings from ci-operator logs for the selected scope.",
          "type": "logs",
          "gridPos": { "h": 12, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 54 },
          "datasource": { "type": "victoriametrics-logs-datasource" },
          "targets": [
            {
              "expr": "pr_number:~\"$pr_number\" AND build_id:~\"$build_id\" AND (level:error OR level:warning)",
              "refId": "A"
            }
          ],
          "options": {
            "showTime": true,
            "showLabels": true,
            "wrapLogMessage": true,
            "enableLogDetails": true,
            "sortOrder": "Descending"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "title": "Step Failures",
          "description": "Step-level failures from ci-operator logs for the selected scope.",
          "type": "logs",
          "gridPos": { "h": 12, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 54 },
